# My First AI - by Abraham Linkon Obuya 🇰🇪
Student at Maseno School | From Homabay County, Kenya | Building AI with just a phone

### 🎯 Mission
From my home in Homabay to Maseno School, I saw smallholder farmers lose maize to disease. I'm building a phone-based AI to detect MSV & MLN early — so farmers can act fast.

### 👨‍🎓 About Me
- School: Maseno School, Kenya
- Home: Homabay County
- Passion: Using AI for agriculture in my community
- Goal: MIT EECS '31 — learn, build, bring back

### 🔧 Current Project: Maize Disease Detector
- Collecting maize leaf images from farms around Homabay & Maseno
- Training with Teachable Machine + Colab on phone
- Target: Offline model for farmers with no internet

